# HOME, 1st press: MIX PAGE 2 = the selected track's Level (K1) and Pan (K2); HOME again: GLOBAL PARAMETERS (10), patterns, song, then MIX PAGE 2 again.
# Tonic BD: Level = sound0.0.17 (default 101), Pan = sound0.0.21 (default 64).
wait 300
expect sound0.0.17 101
expect sound0.0.21 64
tap HOME
expect view 8
turn K1 3 80
expect sound0.0.17 104
turn K2 -4 80
expect sound0.0.21 60
shot home2_track1.png
# black key 2 = track 2: the knobs now set its own level and pan
tapkey b1
turn K1 -1 80
shot home2_track2.png
# HOME cycle: GLOBAL (10), patterns (0), song (5), MIX PAGE 2 (8)
tap HOME
expect view 8
tap HOME
expect view 10
tap HOME
expect view 0
tap HOME
expect view 5
tap HOME
expect view 8
# from any other page, HOME goes to MIX PAGE 2
tap EDIT
expect view 14
tap HOME
expect view 8
